# Working notes and reference material — kept locally, not published.
#
# ...except the research record. ROADMAP.md and the *_AB.md pre-registrations
# ARE the project's evidence: each one states a bar before a run and the result
# after it, and a result whose configuration is lost is not a result. They were
# tracked at the repo root; moving them under docs/ must not quietly untrack
# them, which a bare `docs/` would do — the directory ignore is why §3 already
# records a "Session 2 audit" document nobody can find.
#
# Everything else here (STATE_OF_PLAY.md, the playbook PDF, handover notes)
# stays local exactly as before.
docs/*
!docs/*_AB.md
!docs/ROADMAP.md
